#: admin/platforms.py
msgid ""
"The connector that talks to the platform. \"null\" records what would be "
"sent without calling anything; use it to prepare and test."
msgstr "플랫폼과 통신하는 커넥터. \"없음\"은 호출 없이 보낼 내용만 기록한다(준비·시험용)."

